TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN="Add token here"
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID="Add chat ID here"
GOOGLE_SHEET_URL="https://script.google.com/macros/s/DEPLOYMENT_ID/exec"

# 1. Open Telegram app and search for @BotFather.
# 2. Click Start and send the command /newbot.
# 3. Enter a display name for your bot.
# 4. Enter a unique username ending in "bot" (e.g., my_store_bot).
# 5. Copy the generated HTTP API Token provided by BotFather.
# 6. Create a new Telegram group for receiving your store orders.
# 7. Add your newly created bot to this group.
# 8. Promote your bot to Admin inside the group permissions.
# 9. Add @myidbot to the group to get your Group Chat ID (it starts with a minus sign, e.g., -100123456789).
# 10. Remove @myidbot from the group after copying the Chat ID.
# 11. Open your Vercel Dashboard and select your website project.
# 12. Go to Settings tab and select Environment Variables from the sidebar.
# 13. Add Key: TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN with your bot token as the Value.
# 14. Add Key: TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID with your group chat ID as the Value.
# 15. Go to Deployments tab and click Redeploy to apply the environment variables.